---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: The Program
permalink: /program/index.html
description: Explore the ten-week Fight for Manhood journey from diagnosis and healing to identity, responsibility, and restoration.
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ site.program.duration }} &middot; Biblical formation &middot; Honest brotherhood</span>
      <h1>The Fight for <span class="gold">Manhood</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Ten weeks to confront wounds and shame, dismantle fear and false religion, recover responsibility, and learn to lead from relationship with the Father.</p>
      <p class="sublead">This is not a lecture series. Every week moves from exposure to healing, relationship, responsibility, and action.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/#cohorts">Find a cohort</a><a class="button" href="/contact/">Bring the Fight to your community</a></div>
    </header>

    <div class="divider"></div>
    <h2 class="section-title">10-week battle plan</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Each week builds on the last. We expose, rebuild, reconcile, and advance.</p>

    <div class="curriculum-grid">
      {% for item in curriculum %}
        <article class="curriculum-item" data-week="{{ item.week }}">
          <div class="week-label">Week {{ item.week }}</div>
          <h2>{{ item.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
          <div class="verse">Key Scripture: {{ item.verse }}</div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>
    <section class="center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Ready?</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Stop negotiating with weakness. Step into the light and fight like a man who belongs to God.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="/#cohorts">Find a cohort</a><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

